      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 16.51,
      "end": 19.55,
      "text": "发现这个事儿对老板根本就没有价值和意义",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 19.55,
      "end": 21.39,
      "text": "他第二个阶段也就不会做了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 21.39,
      "end": 24.63,
      "text": "这个场景到落地方案的一个整体的流程",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 24.63,
      "end": 28.15,
      "text": "然后就是近于今天的一个套比的场景大体",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 28.15,
      "end": 29.87,
      "text": "既然就已经找到了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 29.87,
      "end": 31.67,
      "text": "但是大家现在要思考一下",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23333922725671913,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06697984039783478
    },
    {
      "start": 31.67,
      "end": 32.95,
      "text": "能不能让老板",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16678782922880991,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00039619128801859915
    },
    {
      "start": 32.95,
      "end": 34.55,
      "text": "我看到这个东西完之后",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16678782922880991,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00039619128801859915
    },
    {
      "start": 34.55,
      "end": 36.87,
      "text": "我觉得真的是花了十万块钱",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16678782922880991,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00039619128801859915
    },
    {
      "start": 36.87,
      "end": 37.99,
      "text": "赚了100万的感觉",
      "avg_logprob": -0.16678782922880991,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00039619128801859915
    },
    {
      "start": 37.99,
      "end": 39.47,
      "text": "然后落得了地",
